      "date": "2026-02-07T20:57:12.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹5.39 (vs ₹4.11 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹5.39 (up from ₹4.11 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹2.67b (up 20% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹450.9m (up 31% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 17% (up from 15% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 10% per year and the company’s share price has also increased by 10% per year.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
